    description: "**Defect.** The schema declares `profile.total_files` and `profile.total_lines`, but the producer emits neither at profile scope.\n\n**Evidence.** The auto-generated docs/schema.json lists total_files and total_lines as profile sub-fields, but the producer never emits them inside the profile object (a total-files figure lives at metrics scope instead). Both are declared in the schema and absent from the emitted profile block.\n\n**Contract.** The producer and schema should agree on the profile field set — either the fields are emitted at profile scope or removed from the schema.\n\n**Consequence.** A consumer reading the schema and looking for total files/lines inside the profile object finds neither and must discover that one total lives in a different block while the other is unavailable."  # 7226
